Subject: [PATCH] Guard and own native overrides; capture K replay on Windows

Native replacements require the upstream PTX identity manifest. Preserve native
module/image ownership, bypass redundant JIT for completely replaced modules,
include the loaded Windows DLL fingerprint in cache identity, and expose opt-in
private real-weight replay captures with explicit native/translated launch logs.

